rd financial ruin... But a chance meeting with Ren sets her life tumbling down a totally different path."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87518"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々、二次元キャラ（推し）を追いかけ続ける夢女子ＯＬ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら推しのみ、ガチャで絶対に引けないという不運の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在ソシャゲにドはまり中で、生活費がピンチに……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋との出会いにより思わぬ方向へ人生が一変する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22093","sourceWorkId":"29032","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「こ、恋人じゃないわよ。ただの同居人」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日々、二次元キャラ（推し）を追いかけ続ける夢女子ＯＬ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら推しのみ、ガチャで絶対に引けないという不運の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在ソシャゲにドはまり中で、生活費がピンチに……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋との出会いにより思わぬ方向へ人生が一変する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73932"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6ccaed40f356ed24662e289e79fc35b15fc783df772cdfcd4e147eaf7ddb2f7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc576b2cfdaf01fa326b6cd48a31293bb90c255b13d4b9fcb9f1da5924d5dee7.webp","width":109,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"戸板優衣","creatorId":"vndb:s10510","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s10510","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s10510","name":"戸板 優衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:329440:73932:24908:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87520","characterName":"古館 恋","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"73933","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"296359"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22094"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87520"},"originalCharacterName":"古館 恋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"422"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves cute things, shiny things--basically anything she can squeal over."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she meets Akuru it's love at first sight--this woman is totally her type! In an attempt to win her heart, she ends up pushing her way into Akuru's home."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Love, writen with the same Kanji as 'Ren' (恋)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87520"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"カワイイもの、キラキラしたもの――つまり、テンションがあがるものが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好みのタイプど真ん中だったあくるに出会い、一目惚れ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その心をゲットしようと、なかば強制的にあくるの家に転がり込む。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22094","sourceWorkId":"29032","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「だって、あくるはあたしの運命の人でしょ？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カワイイもの、キラキラしたもの――"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"つまり、テンションがあがるものが大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好みのタイプど真ん中だったあくるに出会い、一目惚れ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その心をゲットしようと、なかば強制的にあくるの家に転がり込む。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"73933"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/8352456c6b70e3d8bffc5edb5a42bade2184f8d64fcc3fff4ea332c807993c42.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/812c6c68d1524999f39c2d9b92c2241d660b3574ea5461f9a9ff768c46448333.webp","width":109,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西連寺亜希","creatorId":"vndb:s14876","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14876","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14876","name":"西連寺 亜希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","